    "body": "Review fix (M3) at 5cdb0b9d, for the item raised at ab4a9593.\n- **Thread is out of `rims_of`.** Since #1071, the thread's region reads the major circle, so the minor declaration traced no loop. A thread mill on a coarse model now keeps the tightened reading, which is the conservative side.\n- **Pin.** The failing pin is replaced by `coarse_rims::a_thread_mill_on_a_coarse_model_is_never_read_looser_than_at_full_fidelity`: clean at full fidelity, and on a coarse model it may only convict more.\n- **Decision file and PR body** are corrected to match.\n- **Main is merged in** (this push carries a review fix): main's `VerifyContext` refactor is taken with `rims: &rims` added, and the test thread mill gains main's `catalog` field.\n- **Results:** `coarse_rims` 5, `coarse_contain` 1, `coarse_laws` 6, `verify` 21, `thread_mill_rim` 11, `bore_entry` 3, `drill_reach` 6, `hole_wall_flats` 4, `model_fidelity` 9, `solid_law_goldens` 6, and sim lib 113 all pass. Clippy on app and sim is clean.\n- M5 re-reviews this, and `needs-rework` is left for the reviewer.",
